### Solution transfer component

comp-solution-transfer-fill-normal = Ви перелили {$amount}од з {$target} в {$owner}.
comp-solution-transfer-fill-fully = Ви перелили {$amount}од з {$target} в {$owner}, наповнивши той до країв.
comp-solution-transfer-transfer-solution = Ви перелили {$amount}од до {$target}.

## Displayed when trying to transfer to a solution, but either the giver is empty or the taker is full
comp-solution-transfer-is-empty = {CAPITALIZE($target)} порожнє!
comp-solution-transfer-is-full = {CAPITALIZE($target)} повне!

## Displayed in change transfer amount verb's name
comp-solution-transfer-verb-custom-amount = Власне
comp-solution-transfer-verb-amount = {$amount}од
comp-solution-transfer-verb-toggle = Перемкнути на {$amount}од

## Displayed after you successfully change a solution's amount using the BUI
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount = Кількість переливання змінена на {$amount}од.
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount-max = Макс: {$amount}од
comp-solution-transfer-set-amount-min = Мін: {$amount}од

